      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "task-portal-semantic-projection-smoke"
        },
        "renderShape": {
          "kind": "markdown"
        },
        "markdown": "## Pass criteria\n\n1. The control and portal both identify as **Task**.\n2. At Detail zoom, both use the Task Detail presentation.\n3. At Summary zoom, both use the Task Summary card.\n4. At Icon zoom, both use the Task Icon.\n5. At Glyph zoom, both use the Checklist glyph.\n6. The portal retains Beta Readiness source data and navigation.\n7. The portal does not render the legacy source summary merely because it carries the data.",
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "## Pass criteria\n\n1. The control and portal both identify as **Task**.\n2. At Detail zoom, both use the Task Detail presentation.\n3. At Summary zoom, both use the Task Summary card.\n4. At Icon zoom, both use the Task Icon.\n5. At Glyph zoom, both use the Checklist glyph.\n6. The portal retains Beta Readiness source data and navigation.\n7. The portal does not render the legacy source summary merely because it carries the data."
        }
      }
    }
